{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My Fantasy Room is a relaxing game about building the fantasy room you've always dreamed of. Realize your design with a huge selection of furniture, appliances, decor, and accessories.\u00a0You can design your space the way you like.\u00a0In My Fantasy Room you are free to create whatever you want.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What can you expect?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your room and place furniture</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move objects however you like and place them wherever you want. No placing by the grid, no limits on the amount of furniture in the room. Add indirect lighting, plants and more to decorate and personalize your space down to the smallest detail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098180/extras/628069a222c5df6b3a7a5e3ae1a6b123.poster.avif?t=1773067515\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098180/extras/628069a222c5df6b3a7a5e3ae1a6b123.webm?t=1773067515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098180/extras/628069a222c5df6b3a7a5e3ae1a6b123.mp4?t=1773067515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design tells a story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every space has its own objectives, story, and people who live there \u2013 ranging from an adventurer in a tavern to an elven couple sharing their first apartment together. There are plenty of colors and materials for your furniture so it fits the color palette of your rooms.\u00a0Change the colors of furniture, walls, floor, and background using the RGB palette any way you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098180/extras/04d53fdcc124c346dd79e735078458d1.poster.avif?t=1773067515\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098180/extras/04d53fdcc124c346dd79e735078458d1.webm?t=1773067515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098180/extras/04d53fdcc124c346dd79e735078458d1.mp4?t=1773067515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Change time of day and weather</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See how your room looks under different lighting and weather conditions. In addition to changing the time of day, you can enable clear skies or cloudy weather, fog, light rain or a thunderstorm, snowfall, and even a sandstorm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098180/extras/9f5819932c8b1dfedff01451936ccf67.poster.avif?t=1773067515\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098180/extras/9f5819932c8b1dfedff01451936ccf67.webm?t=1773067515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098180/extras/9f5819932c8b1dfedff01451936ccf67.mp4?t=1773067515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>More features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive lighting. Lamps, monitors, computers and fire in fireplaces or torches can be turned on and off with a single click</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multi-level rooms. You can build spaces with several floors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design freedom. You can easily add your images for monitors, paintings, posters, and photo frames to the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Workshop support. Add your own 3D models to the game and share your rooms with other players</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4098180?t=1773067515","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4098180?t=1773067515","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098180/67db1cd26538161d75925eded58a540c89429d3e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773067515","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098180/67db1cd26538161d75925eded58a540c89429d3e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773067515","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My Fantasy Room is a relaxing game about building the fantasy room you've always dreamed of. Realize your design with a huge selection of furniture, appliances, decor, and accessories.\u00a0You can design your space the way you like.\u00a0In My Fantasy Room you are free to create whatever you want.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What can you expect?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your room and place furniture</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move objects however you like and place them wherever you want. No placing by the grid, no limits on the amount of furniture in the room. Add indirect lighting, plants and more to decorate and personalize your space down to the smallest detail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098180/extras/628069a222c5df6b3a7a5e3ae1a6b123.poster.avif?t=1773067515\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098180/extras/628069a222c5df6b3a7a5e3ae1a6b123.webm?t=1773067515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098180/extras/628069a222c5df6b3a7a5e3ae1a6b123.mp4?t=1773067515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design tells a story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every space has its own objectives, story, and people who live there \u2013 ranging from an adventurer in a tavern to an elven couple sharing their first apartment together. There are plenty of colors and materials for your furniture so it fits the color palette of your rooms.\u00a0Change the colors of furniture, walls, floor, and background using the RGB palette any way you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098180/extras/04d53fdcc124c346dd79e735078458d1.poster.avif?t=1773067515\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098180/extras/04d53fdcc124c346dd79e735078458d1.webm?t=1773067515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098180/extras/04d53fdcc124c346dd79e735078458d1.mp4?t=1773067515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Change time of day and weather</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See how your room looks under different lighting and weather conditions. In addition to changing the time of day, you can enable clear skies or cloudy weather, fog, light rain or a thunderstorm, snowfall, and even a sandstorm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098180/extras/9f5819932c8b1dfedff01451936ccf67.poster.avif?t=1773067515\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098180/extras/9f5819932c8b1dfedff01451936ccf67.webm?t=1773067515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098180/extras/9f5819932c8b1dfedff01451936ccf67.mp4?t=1773067515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>More features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive lighting. Lamps, monitors, computers and fire in fireplaces or torches can be turned on and off with a single click</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multi-level rooms. You can build spaces with several floors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design freedom. You can easily add your images for monitors, paintings, posters, and photo frames to the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Workshop support. Add your own 3D models to the game and share your rooms with other players</p></li></ul>","developers":["My Fantasy Room Team"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_ass